   "versionNonce": 642085297,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "• no ablation on ranking metrics: filter vs three-segment\n  vs FSQ are never separated\n\n• baselines are the production model and, on Amazon,\n  DIN / SIM only (no TWIN, TIGER, OneRec)\n\n• no confidence intervals; some gains are 0.05 points\n\n• inconsistencies: K = 8192 vs '3 × 4096'; FSQ levels;\n  order HR@500 13.0 vs 20.0; collision '> 30%' vs 77.92%;\n  vocabulary < 20k vs ~1e5\n\n• the filter LLM sees only titles + attributes",
   "fontSize": 24,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "• no ablation on ranking metrics: filter vs three-segment\n  vs FSQ are never separated\n\n• baselines are the production model and, on Amazon,\n  DIN / SIM only (no TWIN, TIGER, OneRec)\n\n• no confidence intervals; some gains are 0.05 points\n\n• inconsistencies: K = 8192 vs '3 × 4096'; FSQ levels;\n  order HR@500 13.0 vs 20.0; collision '> 30%' vs 77.92%;\n  vocabulary < 20k vs ~1e5\n\n• the filter LLM sees only titles + attributes",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
